{
  "category": "Dragon Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "An extremely rarely seen marine POKéMON. Its intelligence is said to match that of humans.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "An extremely rarely seen marine POKéMON. Its intelligence is said to match that of humans.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said that this POKéMON lives somewhere in the sea and that it flies. However, it is only a rumor.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said that this POKéMON constantly flies over the immense seas and rescues drowning people.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "This marine POKéMON has an impressive build that lets it freely fly over raging seas without trouble.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said that somewhere in the ocean lies an island where these gather. Only they live there.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "DRAGONITE is capable of circling the globe in just sixteen hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "DRAGONITE is capable of circling the globe in just sixteen hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can circle the globe in just 16 hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can fly in spite of its big and bulky physique. It circles the globe in just 16 hours.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Only a very few people ever see this POKéMON. Its intelligence is said to match that of humans.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.",
      "version": "diamond"
